    {
        "text": "Let's review all the information we have on Rhodes Island so far.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "text": "First, both Big Bob and the High Priest thought they could help us...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4142_laios_1#16$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Second, Kay said there's someone called the 'Doctor' who can definitely solve our problem...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4142_laios_1#18$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "And lastly, it seems we're finally getting close to their ship!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4142_laios_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I just hope they really <i>do</i> have a way of solving this...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4144_chilc_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey guys, look!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chilchuck"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_0_rhodes3",
        "screenadapt": "showall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The three head over to the cliff's edge at Chilchuck's cry. It is then they realize why there was a tinge of worry in his voice."
    },
    {
        "text": "They see a giant, colossal ship."
    },
    {
        "text": "It sails across the land, a vessel much larger than any seafaring ship they have seen before."
    },
    {
        "text": "A massive construct of steel. A city. A... dungeon."
    },
    {
        "text": "This is it. Rhodes Island."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_laccolith",
        "screenadapt": "showall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4143_sensi_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...My word, a ship that sails on land.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Senshi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4141_marcil_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Can we really find a way home there?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marcille"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4144_chilc_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I think we've got another problem to deal with first.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chilchuck"
    },
    {
        "text": "How are we going to get on board?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chilchuck"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4144_chilc_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't see any entrances, even from here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chilchuck"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4141_marcil_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Look! I think there's some people approaching the ship.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marcille"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4144_chilc_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks like a caravan to me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chilchuck"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4142_laios_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "A caravan, huh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why don't we go talk to them and see if they can bring us aboard?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
