        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_090",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vanguard Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_942_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Good work out there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_090",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No problem. Oh, right. We just ran into a party of four looking for help. They're dressed real funny, said they know Ceobe, and were hoping Rhodes Island could help them go home.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vanguard Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_942_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm? Go home?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_090",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "More or less, from what I understand. Would you mind leading the way for them? I'll go talk with Field Operations.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vanguard Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios's Party"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4142_laios_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hello!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_942_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you came to us for aid, you must be looking for the Doctor or Amiya, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4141_marcil_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Err... Kay did mention a 'Doctor,' so they're probably who we're looking for?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marcille"
    },
    {
        "text": "Could you set up a meeting for us?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marcille"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_942_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have to check your identities first. If you could just follow me\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4142_laios_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 20,
        "ystrength": 20,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$book_close",
        "volume": 1,
        "channel": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_paper2",
        "volume": 1,
        "channel": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4142_laios_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Whoa! Really sorry, dropped my things...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_942_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Bob's Gourmet Guide'?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "text": "You know Big Bob?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4142_laios_1#18$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sure do. He cooked us the first meal we had here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4143_sensi_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Aye, anyone who can make such a delicious meal out of such hard bugs is admirable in my eyes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Senshi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_942_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I see. So you're the 'friends' he mentioned.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4142_laios_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_942_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm Mudrock. Big Bob told me about you. At the time, he had just decided to leave the mercenary life behind, but had no idea whether starting a farm would be viable.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "text": "Farms in the wilderness are often targeted by bandits and looters. He didn't have many business connections, and he wasn't sure if the beer he brewed was any good.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "text": "But the joy on your faces as you ate his cooking gave him confidence.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4143_sensi_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I never realized he was in such dire straits.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Senshi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4141_marcil_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is... Is he alright nowadays?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marcille"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_942_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't know. We haven't met in a long while.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "text": "All I've heard is that his Originium slug beer factory's doing well and making a profit. Seems he's got it made.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4143_sensi_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Good, good.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Senshi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_942_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I also heard that he broke some local laws in the process. Some kind of tax issue. He was sent to jail.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4144_chilc_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Eh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chilchuck"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4141_marcil_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Jail? Are you sure he's still alright?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marcille"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_942_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The most recent news I heard was that he either broke out or made bail. Either way, he's fine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4142_laios_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I guess that's... good?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4144_chilc_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "A jailbreak, huh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chilchuck"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_942_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've also heard that he set up a grocery store in Sami. Business is good there, apparently.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4141_marcil_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marcille"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4143_sensi_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "He... knows how to persevere, at least.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Senshi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_942_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Anyway, come with me. We'll head up in the elevator.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4142_laios_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Elevator'? You mean this iron box? How do you use it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4141_marcil_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks like another magic item to me...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marcille"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
