    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Go on inside. We're heading to the first floor. Wait a moment though, I need to get a\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Where did they go?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_corridor",
        "screenadapt": "showall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$farce_intro",
        "key": "$farce_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_glassdooropen",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Why's everything all different now?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios's Party"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4141_marcil_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where are we? What just happened?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marcille"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4142_laios_1#16$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "This place is looking more and more like a dungeon by the second.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_969_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...As I have foreseen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arges"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4144_chilc_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, aren't you the Cyclops from Sami?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chilchuck"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4141_marcil_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "A Cyclops?! How do you know\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marcille"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4144_chilc_1#15$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait. If you're here, that means you saw something, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chilchuck"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_969_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Indeed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arges"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4144_chilc_1#15$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then, what did you see?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chilchuck"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_969_1#1$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "On your road ahead, there will be flames, a great shock... and a fearsome beast.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arges"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4144_chilc_1#16$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you know where Ceobe or the Doctor are?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chilchuck"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_969_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ceobe has just returned. She should be at the training room now, which is that way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arges"
    },
    {
        "text": "As for the Doctor... Please forgive me for not being able to tell you anything at the moment.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arges"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4144_chilc_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thanks.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chilchuck"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4141_marcil_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "So... where should we go first?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marcille"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't think Mudrock will find us any time soon.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marcille"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_trainingcom",
        "screenadapt": "showall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4142_laios_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is the training room the lady from earlier told us about.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4141_marcil_1#14$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doesn't seem like there's anyone here. There's some great big <i>strange</i> thing over there...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marcille"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1429_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you lot doing here with that gormless look on your faces?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Priest"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4142_laios_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Eh? High Priest?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4141_marcil_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Have you seen Ceobe, High Priest?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marcille"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1429_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "She was here a moment ago, but ran off somewhere.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Priest"
    },
    {
        "text": "You guys looking for her?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Priest"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4141_marcil_1#17$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marcille"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1429_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't just stand there then, get your butts over here and sit in this machine!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Priest"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4142_laios_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? Uh... Sure, okay.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_clothmovement",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "High Priest, did you happen to see some lost visitors? We heard they were spotted around here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1429_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What? No, I haven't. We're about to run an impact safety test on this new model of Big Ugly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Priest"
    },
    {
        "text": "I suggest you stand back a bit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Priest"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Uh... Sure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1429_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, Zumama, everything's ready to go!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Priest"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you sure?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1429_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course I'm sure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Priest"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$shotgunreload",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_explo_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "ystrength": 50,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "text": "AAAAAAAAAAHHHHHHHHHH\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cockpit-Encased Laios's Party"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Was it just me or were there people inside that thing when it got blasted?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$dontmaketrouble_intro",
        "key": "$dontmaketrouble_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1429_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you sure about that? Did you <i>see</i> anyone get blasted?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Priest"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, huh... Guess not?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just my imagination, then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1429_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, yeah, go look somewhere else. The ones you're looking for aren't here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Priest"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sure. Thanks.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I think this is what they call an 'abuse of power.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1429_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "They put me in a stew one time, I blew them up one time. Fair's fair.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Priest"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where'd you send them?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1429_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "They wanted to find Ceobe, so I sent them to her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Priest"
    },
    {
        "text": "That part's no lie.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Priest"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_landscape",
        "screenadapt": "showall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The smoke from the explosion clears, and the four find themselves experiencing the oddly-familiar feeling of floating in midair. As they regain their senses, gravity begins to do its work."
    },
    {
        "text": "Surprisingly, it is P'o-shan Village rushing up to meet them. Dawn watches them with a peculiar expression on her face."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 40,
        "ystrength": 40,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "AHHHHHHH!!! HELP US\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios's Party"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "text": "The four flail about in the air, to no avail."
    },
    {
        "text": "However, it does not escape their notice that below them is not solid ground, but a near-infinitely deep well."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 40,
        "ystrength": 40,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Instead of a cold, hard, and most-likely-fatal landing, they find themselves shooting straight into their hole of hope."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_139#2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...A tad crude, but I guess that's how she will send them on their way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dawn"
    },
    {
        "text": "May we meet again someday.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dawn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
