        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did Kay run into the kitchen again?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_199_yak_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "That she has.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Matterhorn"
    },
    {
        "text": "But she's been acting oddly this time around.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Matterhorn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "How so?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_199_yak_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "She's been unusually silent since her return.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Matterhorn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll go have a chat with her, then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Kay.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2013_cerber_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceobe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you alright? Do you feel unwell?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2013_cerber_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Uhh... Dunno know how to describe it...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceobe"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've been feeling weird ever since I got back to the ship...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceobe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "If that's the case, why don't we go to Medical together and let the doctors have a look?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2013_cerber_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Don't wanna.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceobe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why not?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2013_cerber_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I dunno why, but I feel like... I should wait here by myself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceobe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh. Alright then. Go get some rest, okay?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2013_cerber_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceobe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
